WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
How much does a team of 21 people cost?

2
00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:08.800
I did the math with the average Brazilian salary for each role, plus 68% in payroll charges.

3
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.950
The copywriter who writes your copy.

4
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.000
A developer to put the page live.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.800
And 8 salespeople to answer your WhatsApp.

6
00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:22.200
Add it all up: more than R$ 141 thousand per month.

7
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:29.000
With me, the 22 agents on the most complete plan cost R$ 15.997 per year.

8
00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:32.400
The artificial intelligence subscription is separate.

9
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.000
Now do your own math.
